<title>HAITI: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>HAITI GOVERNMENT LIST (970728)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 28 July 97 - President Rene Preval has nominated Eric     *</p>
<p> *		  Pierre to become the country's next prime    *</p>
<p> *		  minister. The appointment must be confirmed  *</p>
<p> *		  by Haiti's parliament.			     *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 7 Feb 96)......Rene PREVAL</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT</p>
<p>Prime Minister (Apptd 16 Feb 96, took office</p>
<p>6 Mar 96)....Rosny SMARTH**</p>
<p>						    (**Resigned 9 June 97)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
